# Train Keeper AI Rules

## Design Language: Fluid Utility
- Glassmorphism, 16-24px border-radius.
- Colors: Teal/Cyan primary, Coral/Gold accents.

## Business Logic
- Hierarchy is Workout -> Section -> Exercise. A Set (подход) is an optional checkable subtask of an exercise; an exercise without sets is a single task (owner-confirmed language, ADR-0006).
- Dynamic fields: Weight, Reps, Distance, Time, Pose, Custom.

## Continuous Documentation
- The AI MUST proactively maintain documentation (`docs/`). Governance workflow: `AGENTS.md` + `tools/ai-agent-governance/SKILL.md`.
- If you change the DB schema, add an API route, or add a dependency, you MUST inform the user and update `docs/architecture/data-model.md`, `BACKLOG.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, or `DEPENDENCIES.md` accordingly.

## Testing
- TDD with Jest is mandatory. Always write tests first.

## Tech Stack
- Node.js, Express, LowDB, Vanilla JS/JSX, CSS.
